dav</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133512293,imgsize-63421.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[American woman loses 100-year-old ring; husband finds it from 20,000 pounds of garbage]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133508387.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A remarkable story has emerged from Brooklyn, where Victor, a determined husband, embarked on an extraordinary quest through tons of refuse to recover lost rings. His wife inadvertently tossed a platinum family heirloom and a gold ring into the trash. With the help of a thoughtful sanitation worker, Victor unearthed the trash bag that held the cherished jewelry, including a historic platinum ring linked to a proposal.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/she-accidentally-threw-away-two-rings-while-cleaning-her-new-york-home-including-a-100-year-old-family-heirloom-her-husband-dug-through-20000-pounds-of-trash-to-find-them/articleshow/133508387.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/she-accidentally-threw-away-two-rings-while-cleaning-her-new-york-home-including-a-100-year-old-family-heirloom-her-husband-dug-through-20000-pounds-of-trash-to-find-them/articleshow/133508387.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-25T17:24:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133508645,imgsize-1793554.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Married NYC lawyer getting fired after his video of smooching 29-year-old colleague in Central Park goes viral]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133511548.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatim