</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133511442,imgsize-1723463.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 2014, Texas bought 17,351-acre Powderhorn Ranch; 15,000 acres later became a wildlife area]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133508433.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In 2014, a coalition of conservation groups bought 17,351-acre Powderhorn Ranch on the Texas coast for $37.7 million. A major share of the funding came from BP and Transocean penalties linked to the Deepwater Horizon oil spill. Four years later, more than 15,000 acres were transferred to Texas Parks and Wildlife Department as a wildlife management area.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2014-a-texas-coalition-bought-a-17351-acre-coastal-ranch-for-37-7-million-much-of-it-using-deepwater-horizon-restoration-money-15000-acres-later-became-a-wildlife-area-protecting-wetlands-prairie-and-endangered-whooping-crane-habitat/articleshow/133508433.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2014-a-texas-coalition-bought-a-17351-acre-coastal-ranch-for-37-7-million-much-of-it-using-deepwater-horizon-restoration-money-15000-acres-later-became-a-wildlife-area-protecting-wetlands-prairie-and-endangered-whooping-crane-habitat/articleshow/133508433.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-25T18:17:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133510051,imgsize-115136.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Record heatwaves kill more than 35,000 across Europe, toll expected to rise: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133511057.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></descriptio